        "HANDS-ON + INTERVIEW\n\nDraw a 3-node cluster. Label CPU/GPU, memory, network and storage. Explain why a storage or network bottleneck can reduce GPU utilization.\n\nAnswer: What is HPC? Why multiple computers? What is GPU starvation? Name five building blocks.\n\nYOU SHOULD NOW BE ABLE TO explain HPC to a beginner and connect it to storage."
